  ...
    # Apply the optimizer.
    opt.minimize(my_loss, [var0, var1])

    # Update the moving averages
    # of var0 and var1 with additional calls to `apply`
    ema.apply([var0, var1])

  ...train the model by running train_step multiple times...
  ```

